# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file from the publish directory (vite copies
# `public/` into `dist/`). Vercel uses vercel.json for the same two headers.
#
# The gallery shows a live miniature of the game inside its cartridge, so the game must be
# frameable: `frame-ancestors *` and NO X-Frame-Options.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer-when-downgrade
